From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:08:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): skip repository archives saved by another producer

Recheck the exact cache key without downloading immediately before saving. Retain saves on misses and service errors. Include a CI policy regression. Red: test-bazel-cache-save.sh fails on the parent workflow at all four producers; green: all four pass. The hosted mirror passes the Maven focused regression and real GitHub cache hit/miss probes in run 39010880684. This is an intermediate repair; full release gates remain pending.

Consolidate follow-up corrections while preserving the final implementation:
- zzzz-0067-sdk-cache-save-preflight.patch

Original focused red/green records remain in the owning task evidence.
Fresh emitted-queue verification is a separate acceptance gate.
